WEBVTT

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.520
It smells so good.

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:07.730
Yeah, it's irresistible!

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:11.390
You're not likely to find 
something this delicious

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:12.950
anywhere else in the world.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.470
It's Regalo's treasure.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:21.000
Sorry about the wait, everyone.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.810
Limone pie!

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:25.290
So delicious that it holds its own 
against those sold in shops.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.540
Milady helped out today, as well.

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.580
Please make sure you enjoy every bite.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.700
Thank you for the meal!

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.550
It's so good!

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:39.100
Hey, Luca, what's with 
the small serving?

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.460
He has a point.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.500
Yeah! I wanna eat more!

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.450
Oh, goodness!

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:47.060
That's why I asked you to 
fully enjoy every bite!

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:52.880
My apologies, Milady,

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.570
but could you help me for a moment?

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.080
Oh, sure.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.190
The incident from the other 
day is still bothering you?

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.180
Fel has nothing to do with your past

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:09.500
and your issue with Dante.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.980
Yeah, but...

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:14.000
Things are just awkward.

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:17.600
It's because you can't face yourself

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.230
that this happened.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:21.560
Then what about you?

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.060
What do you mean?

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.680
Are you able to face yourself?

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:29.440
I have no reason to tell you.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.320
You can't see where you're 
going with that, can you?

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:23.490
Nova.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:25.010
What's in the boxes?

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:26.940
Limone pies.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.280
Mama and everyone else said 
they'd like some, too,

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:30.600
so I thought I'd bring them some.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:32.390
Where's Luca?

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:33.900
Well...

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.490
Luca, I want my limone pie!

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:38.200
More, more!

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:39.360
Okay, okay, okay, okay!

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:42.970
I thought I could at least

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:45.570
deliver them since he was busy.

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:49.750
Nova?

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.960
If you were to fall, 
you'd ruin the pies.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:57.170
Thank you.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:02.170
Sitting here eating 
limone pie like this

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:05.010
reminds me of when you 
both were little.

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:08.960
Um, Mama...

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.710
Could you not bring up the past...

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:13.420
Oh, there's no need to be embarrassed.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.030
I remember, too.

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:18.830
I remember the first day you 
came to our house, Nova.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:22.900
What's the matter, Nova?

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:24.610
Come over here.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.780
Yes, sir.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.790
We're going to be a family now,

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:38.880
so there's no need to hold back.

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:41.160
A family?

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.260
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:49.390
Here is the limone pie 
that Milady made.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:54.320
You made it for the first time 
with Luca for Nova, right?

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:55.330
Yes!

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.080
He gets to eat Felicitá's 
cooking before me?

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.160
Oh, don't be so sad.

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:05.710
Nova is her future husband, after all.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:09.500
Here!

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.470
It's delicious!

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:25.130
I'm so glad!

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.130
Now, you have a seat, too, Felicitá.

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:29.580
Let's all eat together.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.270
Oh my.

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:56.260
That was the first time

00:05:56.260 --> 00:06:00.350
I felt the warm feeling 
of being in a family.

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:05.850
Giapponese flowers are so pretty.

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:09.160
I sometimes ask Mama to share 
some of hers like this.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:10.260
Really?

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.580
Mama also mentioned that

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:14.970
there are flowers called 
"sakura" in Giappone as well.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:16.360
Sakura?

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.530
Yes.

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:18.970
Apparently, when they're in full bloom,

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:21.190
the areas they grow in all turn pink.

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:23.610
I'd like to see that one day.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.820
You really like Giappone, don't you?

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.850
Th-That's because...

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.790
I have interest in other countries...

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:35.720
Hey,

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.040
do you have fertilizer for your flowers?

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.350
No.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:41.250
Then I'll show you a place after work.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:41.920
What?

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:44.500
Come with us on the patrol tomorrow.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:46.700
You're in the upper echelon,

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:49.350
so it'd be helpful to see 
the other departments.

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:52.580
Thank you. I would be honored.

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:54.790
Today,

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.010
our patrol will concentrate 
on the shopping district.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.880
Don't disregard even the 
smallest feelings of uneasiness,

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:02.350
and pay attention to the conversations 
and actions of the people.

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:03.280
Got it?

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:04.610
Yes, sir!

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:06.110
Wow.

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:18.330
How's your little pupil been doing?

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:22.120
It's unusual for you 
to care about others.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.700
Usually, I would have no interest.

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:29.640
However, since this involves 
Libertá, as well as Milady,

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:31.340
I'm quite interested.

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:35.150
An interesting experiment 
might be possible.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:38.930
Yay! I won again!

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:43.010
Because of your fool luck, 
I'm losing business.

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:46.480
And now I can eat lots of lasagna!

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.660
I'll treat you to some, too, Debito.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.750
Yeah, sure, thanks.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.780
I told you, I can't find it anywhere!

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.550
My wallet is missing!

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:56.170
I'm sure someone stole it!

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:04.360
What?

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:06.450
Oh, nothing...

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.460
I just thought, you're really amazing.

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:12.500
You do a great job as 
the head of Holy Grail,

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.800
and bringing your men together.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:16.580
And you don't expect anything 
less from yourself either.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:17.910
Of course.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:20.100
I've been entrusted with the task. 
It's my responsibility.

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:24.190
I need to work harder, too.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.940
Not to mention, my Arcana 
powers haven't stabilized yet.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.250
You were asking

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:35.230
why we have Arcana powers, weren't you?

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:36.520
Yeah.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:40.290
At times, I don't know myself.

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.950
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.280
Nova, that guy.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.560
That went well.

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:01.870
Hey.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.270
This isn't yours.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:14.380
I cannot ignore those who threaten 
the peace of our island.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:15.830
Depending on the situation,

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.590
I'm not afraid to use force.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:20.700
Sounds fun. Try it, little boy.

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:24.880
What's with that flimsy sword?

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:27.500
Oh, it's one of those 
Giapponese katanas.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.730
I hear that there's some woman

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:32.540
from Giappone in the Arcana Famiglia.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:35.920
If they're letting a woman 
lead, the family's doomed.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:41.720
Is that all you have to 
say before you die?

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:45.520
Can't be... you're Samurai Nova?

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:49.150
I will not forgive those 
who insult Papa and Mama.

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:50.440
Same here.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.150
We agree for once.

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:02.900
Damn it!

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:15.550
Here's your wallet.

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.390
Thank you very much.

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:19.240
I thought I'd never see it again.

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:21.450
You're a life saver, thank you.

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:22.490
It appears I'm now indebted 
to the Holy Grail.

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:25.290
I crossed the line, my apologies.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.400
No, you were rather helpful.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:32.280
Not to mention I like your 
strong sense of honor.

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:33.650
I see.

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:37.890
However, make sure you praise 
Bambina for what she did today.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:42.910
He's right. It was all thanks to her powers.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.840
A woman blooms when she's given praise.

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:02.790
Fertilizer for the flowers.

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:04.890
We were busy dealing with the thieves,

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.180
so I had one of my 
subordinates go buy it.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.210
Thank you, Nova.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.130
Hey, what was that earlier?

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:17.330
Earlier?

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:18.050
You know,

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:20.110
the thing you did to make 
the thieves unconscious.

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:22.110
Oh, you mean striking them 
with the back of my sword.

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:25.740
It's a Giapponese move 
that Mama instructed.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:28.600
Using it, no blood will be shed 
and Regalo will remain clean.

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:30.200
That's amazing.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.120
Of course it is.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:38.260
You and Mama get along really well.

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:42.850
Mama is really nice to all 
the members of the family,

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:45.560
but I think she expects 
great things from you.

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:47.390
You don't understand anything.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:52.750
You have no idea how much 
everyone expects from you.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:57.250
I believe the reason Papa 
brought up the Arcana Duello

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:01.340
is to make you, 
the family's heir, stronger.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:06.240
Work hard so you can meet 
those expectations.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:21.330
Listen well, Nova.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:24.440
You must make a good impression 
at the meeting today.

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:29.260
You are the young lady's 
cousin and betrothed.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:34.480
Eventually, our family will replace 
Mondo and take control of Regalo.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.710
It'll be all right, Nova.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:40.570
They'll like you.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:45.030
You have the qualifications 
and the strength.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:49.080
Yes, Mother, Father.

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:02.140
Why am I having these dreams now?

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:04.510
Who is it?

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:07.470
Pardon, may we have a word?

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:13.070
Are you all right, Milady?

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:17.100
Were the Holy Grail's duties difficult?

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:19.980
No, that's not it.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:24.740
It's hard to become 
friends with people.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:28.180
Supposedly, the money is being 
used for "research fees,"

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:30.620
but the amount seems rather high.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.620
The possibility of improper 
use of funds, huh.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.000
Thank you for the report.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.830
I will figure something out.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.010
You may leave.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.600
Now then, how am I going 
to look into this?

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.620
Now who is it?

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:56.480
May I have a word?

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.730
You are too hard on Milady.

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:05.260
Even yesterday, Milady wanted 
to become closer to you,

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:07.240
and you only pushed her away.

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:08.860
I cannot forgive this.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.040
Did she say something?

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:12.950
She didn't have to.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:17.040
How long do you think I've 
been her attendant?

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:21.250
I acknowledge that she's trying hard.

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:25.510
Then you should just tell her that.

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.410
But it'd be unacceptable for her

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:28.890
to be content with her present state.

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:30.150
She still has more work to do!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:32.570
I understand your difficult position.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.270
For example, your engagement 
to Milady being voided,

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:38.020
and your parents...

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:42.990
But I don't think that justifies 
you being cold to Milady.

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.550
I'm not trying to be cold.

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.670
As much as I am against this notion,

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:52.280
I'd like you to become 
friendlier with Milady.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:53.970
What do you mean?

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:55.740
Milady, please come in.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:04.100
I had Luca show me how 
to cook something.

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:07.590
Since you've helped me out so much.

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:11.170
Here you go.

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:20.340
It's good.

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:21.630
Really?

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:24.360
Yeah. What kind of soup is this?

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.850
It's chickpea soup, Nova.

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:27.610
What?!

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:27.610
What?

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:30.900
Why in the world would 
you pick this soup?

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:34.270
Luca said it was delicious 
and very nutritious.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:38.700
Make sure you eat all 
of Milady's cooking.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:42.930
Disregarding the ingredients, 
it was good.

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:43.830
I thank you.

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:45.340
I'm glad.

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.760
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.880
Even if you're discovered,

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:58.640
you'll still be able 
to gather information

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.350
without bringing too much 
suspicion on yourself.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:06.260
I'd like you to check for 
anything suspicious

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:08.050
and things that don't belong in a lab.

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:15.990
I don't want to doubt 
another family member.

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:19.300
So I would like you to 
dispel that doubt.

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:24.470
Why?

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:27.250
May I ask what you're doing?

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:33.240
I change the lock every 
now and then, you see.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:39.470
After you.

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:47.900
I'm assuming the security 
director sent you.

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:52.330
Probably to expose the 
improper use of funds

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:54.110
by the research lab?

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:58.970
You're so easy to read.

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:01.950
This is all of it.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:05.110
If you still have your doubts, 
come back as often as you like.

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:07.580
I won't run or hide.

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.850
I'll take these documents.

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:23.350
She can look at as many 
documents as she likes...

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:29.420
but I can't have you found just yet.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:36.570
So, he already knew of my plan.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:40.380
That would be my fault. I apologize.

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:45.060
Since he provided these documents,

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:47.720
it's hard to say how trustworthy they are.

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:49.790
Um, this...

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.260
Why does Jolly have this?

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:59.010
Is that...

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:02.600
They're my parents' clinical charts.

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:06.100
I see, your parents...

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:09.150
But why does Jolly have them?

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.470
I don't know.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:12.070
I'd like to know myself.

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:19.780
Maybe Jolly is researching 
a cure for their illness.

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:22.560
Illness is just a cover.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.580
The truth is different.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:27.530
They've been asleep

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:29.190
for these seven years.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:34.110
They're asleep because 
I put them to sleep,

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:35.490
with my Arcana powers.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.510
With the power of Death.

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:42.670
I'm sure that you who 
grew up with the love

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:44.550
of Mama and Papa couldn't understand.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:48.380
My parents used me.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:51.800
They wanted to use my Arcana powers

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:54.770
to take over the family.

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:58.640
They only thought of me 
as a tool for moving up.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:04.730
Not only that, they wanted 
to kill Mama and Papa.

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:08.500
I wanted to protect them,

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:11.020
and I couldn't forgive my parents...

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:13.300
By the time I realized 
what was going on,

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:15.090
I had lost control of my powers.

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:19.430
But this is what I wished for.

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.660
I don't have any doubts

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:23.040
that I did the right thing.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.350
Why are you crying?

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:30.350
Because...

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.310
you won't.

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:35.190
You grew up being loved.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:38.490
I grew up as a tool to help them move up.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.490
I can't bury this gap.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:44.830
I thank you for worrying about me.

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:47.330
But leave me alone.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.550
I am still weak.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:11.180
I knew I'd have to tell her one day,

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:14.190
but I ended up taking out 
my feelings on her.

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:16.520
Nova,

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:20.170
do you remember what 
you gave Mondo and me

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:24.160
when you voided your 
engagement to Felicitá?

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:28.600
You can come for it 
whenever you'd like.

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:33.750
I believe that Felicitá 
will be there for you.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:40.360
She won't be able to 
understand how I feel.

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:44.250
And I... don't want her to.

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:50.450
I thank you for worrying about me.

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:54.540
But leave me alone.

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:00.400
Ciao!

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:09.960
<i>But I want to do something for them.</i>

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:13.300
<i>For both of them.</i>

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:48.380
Now, choose the one that 
should be punished

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:49.640
by naming their card.

00:22:49.640 --> 00:22:51.210
La Forza.

00:22:51.210 --> 00:22:53.060
La Temperanza.

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:56.630
Three against one, 
tonight's sinner is you, Luca!

00:22:56.630 --> 00:22:57.870
Wait, what? Why?!

00:22:57.870 --> 00:23:00.360
I made limone pie for all of you!

00:23:00.360 --> 00:23:02.020
That pie is the very reason!

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:04.530
Yeah, our opinion is...

00:23:04.530 --> 00:23:06.610
The limone pie is too small!

00:23:07.390 --> 00:23:09.450
I'd like some more limone pie.

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:11.370
What's this? It's all gone <i>bye-pie</i>.

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:12.530
Just kidding!

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:14.370
That wasn't funny at all!

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:15.370
Not in the least!

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:16.590
It's not enough at all!

00:23:16.590 --> 00:23:18.820
Yet you ate more than anyone.

00:23:18.820 --> 00:23:22.340
Meaning, Luca, you are to 
make twenty more pies.

00:23:22.340 --> 00:23:23.150
Understood?

00:23:23.150 --> 00:23:24.370
What?!

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:28.110
Why am I being punished for 
making something delicious?!

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:30.410
I'm not okay with this!

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:32.960
Next week is what?!

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:35.150
Milady is going to be doing 
<i>that</i> with those two?!

00:23:35.150 --> 00:23:36.580
What?! That, too?!

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:37.530
I cannot allow this.

00:23:37.530 --> 00:23:40.850
As Milady's attendant, I will stop 
next week's episode at any cost!
